sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI main.py
    participant MCP as MCP setup
    participant Runner as AutonomousRunner
    participant Solver as SolverAgent
    participant Planner as PlannerAgent
    participant Policy as PolicyEngine
    participant Worker as CodeWorker
    participant Eval as EvaluatorAgent
    participant Sched as SchedulerAgent
    participant Build as IntegrationWorker
    participant Validate as ValidationAgent
    participant Deploy as DeploymentAgent

    Note over User,Deploy: Current repository execution story

    User->>CLI: Start with a goal
    CLI->>MCP: Register MCP tools
    CLI->>Runner: Create runner with hooks, policy, and agent registry

    rect rgb(245, 248, 255)
        Note over Runner,Eval: Simple run() path
        Runner->>Solver: Build ACP context and decompose goal
        Solver-->>Runner: Problem statement and constraints
        Runner->>Planner: Build execution plan
        Planner-->>Runner: Task plan and milestones
        loop Work loop
            Runner->>Policy: Check whether current action is allowed
            alt Action allowed
                Policy-->>Runner: allow
                Runner->>Worker: Execute implementation step
                Worker-->>Runner: Step result
            else Action denied
                Policy-->>Runner: deny
                Runner-->>CLI: Stop step and emit audit event
            end
        end
        Runner->>Eval: Evaluate final result
        Eval-->>CLI: Return summary, steps, evaluation, audit count
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over Runner,Deploy: SDLC run_sdlc_pipeline() path
        Runner->>Sched: Plan SDLC timeline
        Sched-->>Runner: Stage order
        Runner->>Solver: Intake requirements from Jira, Figma, Lucid via MCP
        Solver-->>Runner: Requirements package
        Runner->>Planner: Convert requirements into executable tasks
        Planner-->>Runner: Task breakdown
        Runner->>Worker: Generate code and tests
        Worker-->>Runner: Code generation result
        Runner->>Build: Build and package
        Build-->>Runner: Build result
        loop Validation loop
            Runner->>Validate: Run validation gates and static analysis
            alt Go decision
                Validate-->>Runner: pass and go
                Runner->>Deploy: Trigger CI/CD deployment
                Deploy-->>Runner: Deployment result
                Runner->>Eval: Observability checkpoint
                Eval-->>CLI: Pipeline complete
            else No-go decision
                Validate-->>Runner: fail and no-go
                Runner->>Worker: Rework failed area
                Worker-->>Runner: Updated result
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Solver,Deploy: External adapters are wired, but many agent results are still deterministic stubs
    Note over User,Deploy: To fully implement this platform: make workers execute real work, route reasoning through ModelGateway, persist traces and artifacts, expand policy enforcement, and replace simulated adapters with production integrations